1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:05,150
A board of hexagons. Two players. No draws.

2
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:10,350
Hex. Red joins north to south; Blue joins west to east.

3
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:15,790
Place one stone. Build an unbroken chain through neighbouring hexes.

4
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:22,862
Four AI levels: a gentle Companion, Easy, Normal, and a searching Hard.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:28,342
Play solo, pass one screen, or let a phone join over Wi-Fi.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,126
Ask the coach for a hint and hear the reason, not just the hex.

7
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:41,350
Undo, autosave, and a family record that stays on this device.

8
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:44,400
Hex. Two edges. One unbroken line.
